  "synthetic": "48 frames at 640x360 (6 backgrounds: grass, sky, asphalt, off-white wall, dark room, multi-hue clutter; x 2 nouns: car, ball; x 4), three objects per frame in three distinct palette colours drawn by seed, flat-shaded with a vertical light gradient and noise (cars have pale windows and black wheels), encoded H.264 yuv420p crf 18 all-intra and decoded by the worker's OpenCV path; crops are the object's box plus 6% per side, like a detector box. Requests: every colour on the frame (must pick that object) and every colour not on it (must ask): 144 + 432 per set.",
