  "caveat": "'silver' is rendered flat (190,192,198) with no metallic sheen; SigLIP reads every such crop as white or grey, so silver ground truth here is harder than a real silver car."
 },
 "rules": {
  "am2.5-share": "AM2.5 as shipped: the named colour's softmax share (T 0.01) over the 12 palette prompts; resolver picks the top candidate when >= 0.5 and >= 1.25x the runner-up.",
